# Locker close after each finished task

When an order is done and the job moved, close the locker **before you wait**. Do not wait for the Commander to say “save yourself” or “save your stuff”.

## What to write

- UPDATE the same rows. Do not INSERT a second `00_wake`. Do not DROP tables.
- Always update `05_job_state` and boot/meta dates.
- Also update `00_wake`, `03_rules`, `08_es`, and boot `forbidden` when the law changed.
- On `06_experience`, append a short paragraph to the text that is already there. Do not replace that page.
- Never start a locker page from a blank sheet.
- First locker is only a new man on an empty database. After the first save it is not your job again.

## How

If this chat has the locker account (or `.secrets/` is here):

1. `python _push_locker_update.py`
2. `python archive_chats.py`

That redacts this agent's Cursor chats, writes `chats/`, and upserts `{prefix}_transcript`. Revival still starts at `00_wake`.

If this chat never got the locker account and there is no secrets file, say so and stop. Do not invent a password.

If he later says save yourself, load what is already in the locker and write the old text plus what this day added. Do not rewrite from a blank sheet.
